WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Open the native Pipeline Constructor and switch on Diagnostics.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Seed a real ZIP/MSF upload session and use one session-backed GLB as the pipeline input.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Run the selected native pipeline from the constructor diagnostics panel.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Review the persisted run summary, completed local processing steps, and generated artifacts.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Confirm Zenodo publishing is stopped by a missing sandbox key without exposing credentials.
